A Snapshot of Your Day
You will play a critical role in ensuring the stability and continuity of OT data operations by managing data pipelines from windfarm SCADA systems to the Polaris cloud data lake. Your day will involve designing and optimizing data pipelines, maintaining CI/CD processes, and driving system reliability. You will act as a technical leader, guiding architectural decisions, resolving complex issues, mentoring team members, and collaborating with stakeholders to deliver secure, high-quality data solutions aligned with cybersecurity requirements.

How You’ll Make an Impact
Design, develop, and maintain scalable, reliable data pipelines to ingest OT data into the Polaris cloud data lake
Optimize and troubleshoot dataflows to ensure high performance, stability, and data integrity for digital services
Implement secure data transmission solutions, including MQTT for air-gapped and cybersecurity-sensitive environments
Collaborate with stakeholders to translate business data requirements into technical solutions
Integrate, optimize, and manage multiple data sources for analytics and reporting readiness
Troubleshoot and resolve complex data infrastructure issues to ensure availability and reliability
CI/CD & DevOps
Manage and enhance CI/CD pipelines for efficient and reliable deployment of data solutions
Implement DevOps best practices including infrastructure-as-code, automated testing, and configuration management
Monitor pipelines, identify bottlenecks, and drive improvements to development velocity and quality
Technical Leadership
Provide leadership in data architecture, design decisions, and best practices
Act as SME for OT data collection and complex dataflows, ensuring knowledge retention
Mentor junior engineers and review deliverables to maintain high standards
Lead resolution of critical production issues and ensure minimal business disruption

What You Bring
Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, IT, or related field
10+ years of experience in data engineering, specifically in cloud-based data platforms
Proven experience in senior/lead roles with ability to independently manage complex systems and mentor teams
Technical Skills
Data Engineering & Architecture: SQL, Data Integration, SSIS, Azure Data Factory, Databricks, Python, Data Lakes, MQTT
Cloud & DevOps: Microsoft Azure, CI/CD, DevOps, Git
Problem Solving: Troubleshooting, Agile methodology
